OL,3,GNEWSAA thousand job applications, five
OL,4,Ainterviews and still no job
OL,5,
OL,6,FCasey Smith has been going to the job
OL,7,Fcentre every few weeks since she was 16
OL,8,Fbut feels she's been "going round and
OL,9,Fround in circles".
OL,11,FThe teenager, from Johnstone,
OL,12,FRenfrewshire, is one of nearly a
OL,13,Fmillion young people in the UK
OL,14,Fclassified as a Neet - not in
OL,15,Feducation, employment or training.
OL,17,FAfter four years, she is desperate to
OL,18,Fwork.
OL,20,F"I'm nearly 20 now," she told BBC
OL,21,FScotland.
